WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.824
Nabız a free

00:00:01.635 --> 00:00:02.649
menu bar app

00:00:03.174 --> 00:00:04.258
Nabız is an

00:00:04.070 --> 00:00:05.166
open-source native

00:00:04.978 --> 00:00:06.334
macOS menu bar

00:00:06.146 --> 00:00:07.242
app that lists

00:00:07.054 --> 00:00:08.209
running dev servers

00:00:08.021 --> 00:00:08.787
and ports

00:00:08.834 --> 00:00:09.801
tracks Claude

00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:11.004
Codex and Grok

00:00:10.816 --> 00:00:12.065
limits and cleans

00:00:11.877 --> 00:00:13.044
build and agent

00:00:12.856 --> 00:00:14.565
leftovers like DerivedData

00:00:15.094 --> 00:00:16.025
The author built

00:00:15.837 --> 00:00:16.874
it after finding

00:00:16.686 --> 00:00:18.537
62 GB of agent

00:00:18.349 --> 00:00:19.716
leftovers and three

00:00:19.528 --> 00:00:20.742
forgotten dev servers

00:00:20.554 --> 00:00:21.402
on his Mac

00:00:21.926 --> 00:00:23.105
Nabız includes a

00:00:22.917 --> 00:00:24.390
built-in MCP server

00:00:24.202 --> 00:00:25.204
so Claude Code

00:00:25.016 --> 00:00:25.970
can reuse what

00:00:25.782 --> 00:00:26.843
is already running

00:00:27.020 --> 00:00:28.152
shows projects with

00:00:28.023 --> 00:00:29.402
unpushed commits plus

00:00:29.214 --> 00:00:30.758
Docker and simulators

00:00:30.806 --> 00:00:32.150
and skips caches

00:00:32.044 --> 00:00:32.845
still in use

00:00:32.657 --> 00:00:33.317
and .

00:00:33.152 --> 00:00:34.119
env files

00:00:34.638 --> 00:00:35.652
Full story on

00:00:35.463 --> 00:00:36.359
the dashboard
